2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder10ChainCompletePoset}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Chain}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Chain}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a07664003abe8d32\" href=\"?note=a07664003abe8d32\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-chain.md\">../batch17/58-df-chain.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order10\\text{-}chain\\text{-}complete\\text{-}poset}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder10ChainCompletePoset}_S(P,\\leq)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq)\n\\land\\forall C\\subseteq P\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Chain}(C,P,\\leq)\\to\\exists s\\in P\\;\\bigl(\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{18mm}\n\\forall c\\in C\\;(c\\leq s)\n\\land\\forall u\\in P\\;((\\forall c\\in C\\;(c\\leq u))\\to s\\leq u)\n\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order10\\text{-}chain\\text{-}complete\\text{-}poset}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder10ChainCompletePoset}_S(P,\\leq)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq)\n\\land\\forall C\\subseteq P\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Chain}(C,P,\\leq)\\to\\exists s\\in P\\;\\bigl(\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{18mm}\n\\forall c\\in C\\;(c\\leq s)\n\\land\\forall u\\in P\\;((\\forall c\\in C\\;(c\\leq u))\\to s\\leq u)\n\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary chain completeness definition.</li>\n<li>The empty chain is included; its supremum is the least element of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-chain.md","status":"resolved","id":"a07664003abe8d32","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-chain.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Poset}\\subseteq V^2$ (see [[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-chain.md","status":"resolved","id":"a07664003abe8d32","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Chain}\\subseteq V^3$ (see [[../batch17/58-df-chain.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"P,\\leq\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq\\subseteq P\\times P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder10ChainCompletePoset}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset}\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Chain}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order10\\text{-}chain\\text{-}complete\\text{-}poset}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder10ChainCompletePoset}_S(P,\\leq)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq)\n\\land\\forall C\\subseteq P\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Chain}(C,P,\\leq)\\to\\exists s\\in P\\;\\bigl(\\\\\n&\\hspace{18mm}\n\\forall c\\in C\\;(c\\leq s)\n\\land\\forall u\\in P\\;((\\forall c\\in C\\;(c\\leq u))\\to s\\leq u)\n\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"P","display":false}],"bytes":1280,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2853","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-order10-chain-complete-poset.md|58-df-zfc-order10-chain-complete-poset]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","a07664003abe8d32","d3f859dbdd37f018"]}